Right. And, you know, we have a good one.

00:44:56.600 --> 00:44:58.340
We have a good one next week.

00:44:58.520 --> 00:44:59.540
We have Wheel of Fortune.

00:45:00.680 --> 00:45:01.500
I love it.

00:45:01.640 --> 00:45:02.480
I love these.

00:45:02.480 --> 00:45:03.640
On the NES. I love these game show games.

